#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Sidralune {0} — an integrated astronomy suite for planning, observing, imaging and science."
msgstr "Sidralune {0} — integrēts astronomijas komplekts plānošanai, novērošanai, attēlveidei un zinātnei."

#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Algorithms: IAU 2006 precession and nutation, JPL DE440 (SPK) or Standish/ELP2000 analytic ephemerides, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunas & Schaefer sky brightness, Schaefer visual thresholds, triangle-invariant star matching with RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstacking with kappa-sigma, winsorized, linear-fit and generalized-ESD rejection, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy with total variation (Dey et al.), starlet wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), generalized hyperbolic stretch,\nmulti-point lucky imaging, spherical planetary derotation, generalised Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol-type transit model with ensemble MCMC."
msgstr "Algoritmi: IAU 2006 precesija un nutācija, JPL DE440 (SPK) vai Standish/ELP2000 analītiskās efemerīdas, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunas & Schaefer debess spožums, Schaefer vizuālie sliekšņi, trijstūru invarianta zvaigžņu saskaņošana ar RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nsakraušana ar kappa-sigma, winsorizētu, lineārās pielāgošanas un vispārināto ESD noraidīšanu, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy ar pilno variāciju (Dey u.c.), starlet viļņveidoles (Starck & Murtagh), vispārinātā hiperboliskā izstiepšana,\ndaudzpunktu lucky imaging, sfēriska planētu derotācija, vispārināts Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol tipa tranzīta modelis ar ansambļa MCMC."

#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Data © their providers: JPL/NASA, Minor Planet Center, HYG Database (D. Nash), OpenNGC (M. Verga), Stellarium, CDS (SIMBAD/VizieR), AAVSO, CelesTrak."
msgstr "Dati © to nodrošinātāji: JPL/NASA, Minor Planet Center, HYG Database (D. Nash), OpenNGC (M. Verga), Stellarium, CDS (SIMBAD/VizieR), AAVSO, CelesTrak."

